    "Trending table values (rank, MC, 1h change under the MC column, 1h volume, holders, and Token Info badges) were taken from a single 2:31 PM ET screenshot of the Solana 1h trending table at https://gmgn.ai/trend?chain=sol so the rows stay consistent. The per-wallet tape was captured around 2:32-2:33 PM ET from GMGN's 1h Smart Inflow table (Monitor > Smart / Callout at https://gmgn.ai/monitor?chain=sol&tab=smartdegen), not from the token-level S-Flow aggregates or the left-rail Smart Degen mini feed. The board reorders while scrolling; every visible per-wallet row was transcribed from the four scroll screenshots (02 top, 03 mid, 04 lower, 05 lower-2). 75 wallet events across 30 token cards.",
    "Accumulation on the Smart Inflow tape: NEVERGOON (three wallets First Buy: x1N2...idV9 +$39.42, 5BzB...YJ3Q +$43.22, and BYxx...VTTh +$24.24); Huang (two wallets First Buy: 9shB...Bkqt +$29.84 and udH4...JfJL +$5.434, plus 814x...K26g Buy More +$29.85); the hotdog-emoji token (two wallets First Buy: D9Ui...q6LS +$166.2 and 4pxb...ah3q +$209.6); Paulie (two wallets First Buy: Gote...xhd8 +$32.22 and BYxx...VTTh +$20.98); PEARL (two wallets Buy More: BNei...3ZQv +$21.25 and Fixu...bH33 +$45.56); COST (two wallets Buy More: D9Ui...q6LS +$166.3 and 4pxb...ah3q +$209.7); WBTC (two wallets Buy More: Cxfq...NP9d +$38.01 and 7E4i...Ltmv +$248.2); GOON (two wallets Buy More: GgbC...ymsT +$205.6 and GwKj...UrzA +$232.3); TTWO (two wallets Buy More: GrQy...3996 +$7.108 and FT6L...nbuC +$29.1); Poly (two wallets Buy More: yWyq...aJaZ +$348.6 and 7rZ4...HR4T +$97.79); SOV (Cxfq...NP9d First Buy +$26.74 and 2Jpt...otbC Buy More +$150.6). Single-wallet First Buys also printed for CYBER, NI, FPT, and jorkin (both HMEf...pump and AUb3...pump).",
    "Several cards shared a ticker but were distinct contracts: two jorkin tokens (HMEf...pump with a First Buy and two Sell All prints, and AUb3...pump with a First Buy and a Sell All). RIG on the inflow tape is EnMc...pump, not the trending #4 RIG at 7RyC...pump. BANK on the inflow tape is the trending #6 token (667t...pump). GOON on the tape is trending #8 (HsrE...pump). Trader on the tape is trending #1 (7TnX...pump). Lemon-style name overlap is not present in this capture. The hotdog-emoji token has no Latin ticker on the card; the ticker is stored as the 🌭 character GMGN showed.",
    "Risk flags: Dev Sell All (DS) on BELLA, DIDN'T, RIG, PUP, BANK, meowl, GOON, BANKLESS, and VEYRA. Trader showed 0% at the Dev badge (not DS). Bundlers: Trader 0%, BELLA 0%, DIDN'T 0%, RIG 0%, PUP 0%, BANK 4%, meowl 0%, GOON 1%, BANKLESS 0%, VEYRA 0%. Phishing: Trader 0%, BELLA 0.19%, DIDN'T 0%, RIG 22.16%, PUP 21.81%, BANK 0%, meowl 0%, GOON 62.02%, BANKLESS 0%, VEYRA 0%. Highest sniper: BELLA 12%. Highest insider: BANKLESS 24%. Highest top-10 holder: GOON 71.13%. Paid badge: Trader $299; the other nine Unpaid. No CTO, honeypot, mint, or freeze flag was visible. Holder-rewards badges appeared on several rows (Trader 0.85%, BELLA 0.9%, DIDN'T 0.3%, RIG 0.3%, PUP 0.3%, BANK 1%, meowl 1%, BANKLESS 0.3%). Tags visible on the token column: RIG TTWO, PUP POLYMARKET, BANK WBTC, meowl NVDA.",
